    "body": "This is a nice helper--so nice, in fact, that I don't think it should stay limited to this scope. This seems like a pretty common operation \r\n\r\nI won't ask you to refactor the entire codebase, but we should probably look into moving it out of this at some point in the future.\r\n\r\n(roping in @matchai for his opinion)",
